\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon \highlight\uc2  cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  eases after reform steps. \b0\par\par\uc2 331 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Februar 2002\par 17:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BEIRUT, Feb 15 (Reuters) - The Lebanese pound was stable in the week ending Friday, as traders said a series of economic reform measures calmed the market and allowed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reduce \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend to pound. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent much of the week at the top of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 1,501-1,514 to the dollar, but that the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was less extensive than it has been recently. \par \par \uc2  "There was some demand for dollar this week, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is meeting that demand," said one dealer. "It's definitely less than last week." \par \par \uc2  Fears about Lebanon's ability to service a public debt that tops 165 percent of GDP have squeezed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , leaving the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  the sole source of dollars for much of last year, and cutting gross reserves to the equivalent of $4.85 billion by end-January from some $5.9 billion at end-2000. \par \par \uc2  The bank does not disclose net \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, and expresses gross reserves as a Lebanese pound figure. \par \par \uc2  Traders said pressure on the pound eased after introduction of a 10 percent value added tax that the government hopes will help repair its finances and a cabinet decision this week to cancel commercial monopolies that contradict a new economic partnership accord with the European Union. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said there was a limit to market confidence, noting that investors are increasingly unwilling to take on pound assets, despite attractive interest rates spreads compared to dollar holdings. \par \par \uc2  Lebanon offers a 14 percent yield on its longest-term treasury bill, a rate traders say has moved investors back into local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  following a series of interest rate cuts by the U.S. Federal Reserve last year. \par \par \uc2  "From time to time some people still temporarily sell dollars and hold pounds, but there are fewer and fewer of them and more and more of those holding dollars," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020215dy2f00x14\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
