\par\par \b \uc2  Lebanese pound stable despite Argentine crisis. \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Dezember 2001\par 17:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BEIRUT, Dec 21 (Reuters) - The Lebanese pound remained stable this week despite the Argentine crisis and a similar high level of public debt in Lebanon, dealers said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  They said readiness by the monetary authorities to provide the market with liquidity and attractive 14 percent yields on Lebanese pound treasury bills maintained stability in the market. \par \par \uc2  The interbank exchange rate remained steady at 1,514 pounds to the dollar - the upper end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  "There was no knock on effect in \b \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a bond trader at a large bank. "It was restricted to some of the few foreigners holding Lebanese Eurobonds. They exited weeks ago." \par \par \uc2  Emerging market debt have been pushed lower by Argentina's eminent default on $132 billion of debt and what appears to be inevitable devaluation of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Local banks hold most of Lebanon's $26 billion public debt, equivalent to more than 160 percent of gross domestic product. The banks, which also account for most of the $4.3 billion of gross foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at Banque du Liban, have held to Lebanese bonds in times of pressure. \par \par \uc2  Risk of government default have put pressure on the Lebanese pound and forced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to provide the market with dollars from its reserves, which were $5.9 billion at the beginning of year. \par \par \uc2  "A solution must be found to control the debt. We are not seeing anything concrete," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011221dxcl00vcz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
