\par\par \b \uc2  Lebanese  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 April 1999\par 12:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BEIRUT, April 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market this week for the first time in over a month, injecting around $30 million to ease mounting demand pressures for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , bankers said. \par \par \uc2  "Demand on the dollar rose in the start of the week. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , selling about $20 million on Tuesday only," said one banker who requested anonymity. \par \par \uc2  Another banker said demand for the dollar had eased later in the three-day working week. He also said the government's announcement of its 1999 budget figures had little effect on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "The budget did not really affect the market. It caused the demand to continue yet it was a smaller demand than that we saw at the beginning of the week after the Hariri issue," said another broker. \par \par \uc2  Political pressure mounted last week on former premier and billionaire Rafik al-Hariri who is blamed for spending beyond the country's financial means. At the end of his six-year term Lebanon's debt reached $18 billion. \par \par \uc2  The four-month-old government of Prime Minister Selim al-Hoss on Wednesday announced its 1999 draft budget with a deficit of 40.2 percent of spending, down from 43 percent last year. \par \par \uc2  The interbank trading ranged between 1,513-1,514 Lebanese pounds to the dollar compared with last week's range of 1,508-1,511 pounds. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  range was steady at 1,502-1,514 pounds. \par \par \uc2  The market was closed until Tuesday for Easter. Thursday is the last working day before another four-day public holiday. \par \par \uc2  ((Beirut editorial (9611) 745 308 fax 745336 \par \par \uc2  beirut.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv48038d2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
