\par\par \b \uc2  Lebanese pound gains as political tension eases. \b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 1998\par 14:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BEIRUT, Oct 2 (Reuters) - The Lebanese pound gained against the U.S. dollar this week as political tension over the presidential election eased, dealers said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid-offer \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band stood in the range of 1,503.00-1,516.00 against 1,503.50-1,516.50 last week, the standard rate of appreciation maintained by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Contacts made by Lebanese officials abroad and the defusing of political tension related to the presidential election was behind the relaxed atmosphere in the market," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "Supply and demand for U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  were balanced on the first two days of the week. But supply outpaced demand in the rest of the week and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , buying about $40 million," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Interbank trading stood at 1,503.00 Lebanese pound for one dollar from a range of 1,505.50-1,507.50 in the first two days of the week against last week's 1,511-1512. \par \par \uc2  Prime Minister Rafik al-Hariri headed Lebanon's delegation to the United Nation's General Assembly meeting last month in New York where his contacts included talks with World Bank officials. \par \par \uc2  Lebanon's first presidential election since the 1975-1990 civil war had raised concerns in the market in recent weeks, but the political rhetoric subsided this week. The vote is to take place this month and is seen a test of the country's stability. ((Beirut editorial (9611) 745308 fax 745336 \par \par \uc2  beirut.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113dua2016pq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
