\par\par \b \uc2  United Arab Emirates Lends Lebanon $100 Million To Shore Up  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Mai 1998\par 18:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones Online News \par \uc2 DJON\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BEIRUT -(Dow Jones)- The United Arab Emirates is to lend Lebanon $100 million in order to shore up the Lebanese pound, newspapers reported Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Newspapers said the loan agreement was signed by the director-general of the Abu Dhabi National Bank, Sheik Mohammed Jarroush el-Sweidi, Lebanon's agriculture minister, Shawki Fakhoury, and the governor of the Bank of Lebanon, Riad Salameh, in Abu Dhabi on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The government is thought to be waiting for the money to enter Lebanon's accounts before announcing the loan. The deposit is expected Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The newspaper As-Safir quoted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's deputy governor, Nasser al-Saidi, as saying the interest rate on the three-year loan was 5%. \par \par \uc2  Saudi Arabia and Kuwait lent Lebanon $600 million and $100 million respectively last year for the same purpose. Those loans were also for three years at 5% interest. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly in recent months to defend the pound against speculators on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. The pound currently trades at 1,520 pounds to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Prime Minister Rafik Hariri has made it a pillar of his policies to maintain the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Financial experts in Beirut see the loans as expressing confidence in the pound. \par \par \uc2  Copyright (c) 1998 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Dokument djon000020020329du5500q2s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
