\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to support pound. \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BEIRUT, Nov 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the pound on Friday amid talk of a possible near-term assault on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "This is what we have been hearing," one dealer said. "But I don't think there will be a catastrophe because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  always \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to back the pound." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bid-offer \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band was 1525.00-1535.00 compared to last week's 1525.50-1535.50. \par \par \uc2  Inter-bank dollar trading was in the range of 1535.00-1535.50 compared to last week's 1535.50-1536.00. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it was offering to swap Lebanese pound-denominated treasury bills at interest rates well above those on existing finance ministry T-bills. \par \par \uc2  A banking source said the move reflected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy of supporting the Lebanese pound, which has come under pressure over the last two months. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had attributed growing pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis in Asia. But Lebanon has also been struggling with a large fiscal deficit that has pushed the level of debt close to the annual gross domestic product. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  warned this year that interest rates, which have fallen in the past two years, could not ease further unless the government acted to control the deficit. \par \par \uc2  -- Beirut editorial (9611) 745308 745307 602057 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbe02nwd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
