\par\par \b \uc2  Lebanon Bank urged to alter  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  policy. \b0\par\par\uc2 165 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BEIRUT, Sept 15 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should stop \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly on the Beirut \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as soon as possible to allow for a real market to emerge, Lebanese businessmen said in a report. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should at the first available chance re-orient its current policy to allow for a market that reflects the reality of supply and demand in the (\b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) market," the Lebanese Businessmen's Association report said. \par \par \uc2  An LBA delegation handed a copy of the report to billionaire Prime Minister Rafik al-Hariri on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Lebanon\b0 \highlight\uc2 , often \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the Lebanese pound, especially in times of political crisis which usually witness a flight from the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to U.S. dollars. \par \par \uc2  The policy of defending the Lebanese pound depleted the Bank's net \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves by more that $1 billion between January and June. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr9f03tbe\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\cl